ke a princess.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10849822/screencap/677d15b0e39c8.jpg"},{"title":"Taiyaki and Cake","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18030","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"165171","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"55318","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"237529","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"433953","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"87930","synopsis":"Tsukasa decides to enter Inori into the Meikoh Cup to build up her record of success. When Inori feels shy dancing in front of others, Tsukasa gets her to dance in his shadow to conquer her nerves. During skating practice, Inori also meets a girl named Miké at the rink.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10849823/screencap/678636809b4b3.jpg"},{"title":"Meikoh Cup, Junior Women`s Prelim Free Skating (Part One)","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18030","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"165171","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"55318","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"237529","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"433953","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"88003","synopsis":"Inori's first competition, the Meikoh cup, begins. Inori's future is at stake, and while she gets off to a rocky start, her mother and sister are there to support her from the sidelines.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10849824/screencap/678f71ac20978.jpg"},{"title":"Meikoh Cup, Junior Women`s Prelim Free Skating (Part Two)","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18030","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"165171","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"55318","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"237529","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"433953","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"90242","synopsis":"Inori came in top in the first round of the Prelims, whereas Miké was the last one to secure a spot. Determined to turn things around, Miké decides to try and pull off a double rotation combination that no one at the Prelims has done before.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10849825/screencap/67989eeb56ba9.jpg"},{"title":"The Night of the First Competition","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18030","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"165171","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"55318","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"237529","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"433953","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"90411","synopsis":"Hikaru is one of the best performers of Inori’s generation, and Inori is eager to catch up. However, she worries about how far behind she is in terms of her skill level compared to others her age. Tsukasa suggests Inori compete in a competition immediately after passing the level one badge test.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10849826/screencap/67a1dcf6eaf44.jpg"},{"title":"Level One Badge Test","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18030","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"165171","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"55318","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"237529","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"433953","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"91007","synopsis":"Inori faces the level one badge test, setting her next step of competing in a championship. A successful double jump will be essential for a high score.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10849827/screencap/67ab165e49735.jpg"},{"title":"Western Powerhouses (Part One)","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18030","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"165171","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"55318","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"237529","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"433953","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"91187","synopsis":"On the way to a competition, Inori leaves her skates on a train by accident. Tsukasa goes on a mad hunt for the skates ten stations away.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10849828/screencap/67b44f7053dd5.jpg"},{"title":"Western Powerhouses (Part Two)","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18030","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"165171","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"55318","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"237529","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"433953","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"91473","synopsis":"After a smooth start, Inori decides to take each jump carefully, one by one. She controls her center of gravity and maintains a high speed, and Tsukasa cannot hide his excitement as she continues with her flawless performance.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10849829/screencap/67bd8c3d431ca.jpg"},{"title":"Howling at Night","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18030","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"165171","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"55318","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"237529","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"433953","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]}],"link":"91922","synopsis":"Inori competes in her second Meikoh cup, but she will need to perfect the extremely difficult double Axel if she is to progress to the next level. Meanwhile, Tsukasa is asked by Olympic silver medalist Shinichiro Sonidori to mentor his son, Rioh.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10849830/screencap/67c6e268ca5d0.jpg"},{"title":"Dance the Night","episodeNumber":11,"sourceEpisodeNumber":11,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18030","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"165171","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"mal","id":"55318","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"237529","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"433953","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]}],"link":"92370","synopsis":"The Lux Higashiyama FSC summer training camp begins, and Inori plans to perfect her double Axel. Meanwhile, Tsukasa offers to help Rioh, but Rioh turns him down.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10849831/screencap/67d036dff396c.jpg"},{"title":"Shirone`s Lesson","episodeNumber":12,"sourceEpisodeNumber":12,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18030","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"165171","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"mal","id":"55318","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"237529","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"433953","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[12]}],"link":"93604","synopsis":"Tsukasa learns of the anguish Rioh has been carrying, and dances Rioh's program on the rink. Rioh is surprised to see that Tsukasa's skating is much more skillful than he expected.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10849832/screencap/67d96ae5a5b87.jpg"},{"title":"Morning Arrives","episodeNumber":13,"sourceEpisodeNumber":13,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18030","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[13]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"165171","episodeNumbers":[13]},{"provider":"mal","id":"55318","episodeNumbers":[13]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"237529","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[13]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"433953","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[13]}],"link":"94331","synopsis":"The day of the Level Six Badge Test has finally arrived. The venue is the memorable place where Inori first met Hikaru. When Hikaru suddenly appears, she promises to meet Inori again at the All-Japans.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10849833/screencap/67e2a165b49cd.jpg"}],"sourceIds":{"anilistId":165171,"malId":55318},"mappings":{"source":"anibridge-v3","schemaVersion":"3.0.3","generatedOn":"2026-10-28T07:48:11Z","sourceDescriptors":["anilist:165171","mal:55318"],"targets":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18030","scope":"R","ranges":{"1-13":"1-13"}},{"provider":"anilist","id":"165171","ranges":{"1-13":"1-13"}},{"provider":"mal","id":"55318","ranges":{"1-13":"1-13"}},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"237529","scope":"s1","ranges":{"1-13":"1-13"}},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"433953","scope":"s1","ranges":{"1-13":"1-13"}}]},"sourceMetadata":{"info":{"id":5821,"title":null,"title_eng":"Medalist","slug":"medalist","plot":"Tsukasa, un giovane che ha visto i suoi sogni infrangersi molto presto, e Inori, una ragazzina in cui nessuno crede, hanno entrambi un obiettivo per cui vale la pena dare tutto loro stessi. Di fronte alle avversità che si parano di fr